      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://huntingtonny.gov/content/13747/99544/25719/25764/default.aspx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "John Gardiner Farm, a National Register site, now serves as a museum and working farm that showcases early Greenlawn life.",
